# 829f834 — docker-compose.e2e.yml line 49, rule generic-api-key.
#
# The browser tier's `EIM_KEYRING`, flagged on entropy alone. The value decodes
# to the ASCII string "e2e-only-32-byte-test-key-000001": fabricated, committed
